        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "In particular, Figure 7(a) shows the BN for the Work domain. In this domain, the extra input variables are Higher education rate, Geographical area, GDP, and Employment rate, indicating that the domain is influenced by these characteristics that describe the Italian socio-economic system. Both the Participation Subdomain and the Work Domain are deterministic nodes (green), whose values are calculated using expressions involving their respective parents.",
